èbre un but à genoux sur la pelouse lors d'un match de Ligue 1","credit":"© dpa / Foot Mercato","read":2,"tags":["Ligue 1","PSG","Paris FC","Lille","OM","Le Havre","Lyon"],"url":"https://actusport24h.fr/article/ligue-1-meilleure-attaque-meilleure-defense-le-havre-a-la-traine-les-c/"}]}